  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantLeaseholdsThatHaveBeenAcquiredOrGivenAssignedOrSurrenderedTextBlock id="f-4" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantLeaseholdsThatHaveBeenAcquiredOrGivenAssignedOrSurrenderedTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock id="f-5" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock id="f-6" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%"&gt;In March 2026, Mississippi Power issued approximately $75 million aggregate principal amount of Series 2026A Floating Rate Senior Notes due May 15, 2076. FERC Docket No. ES25-9-000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%"&gt;Mississippi Power had various amounts of commercial paper outstanding throughout the quarter. The largest amount of such commercial paper outstanding at any given time during such period was approximately $64 million. FERC Docket No. ES25-9-000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInArticlesOfIncorporationOrAmendmentsToCharterTextBlock id="f-7" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:92%"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInArticlesOfIncorporationOrAmendmentsToCharterTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="f-8" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:92%"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="f-9" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;See Notes to Financial Statements&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
