            <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">FERC Rate Schedule 415, Agreement for Network Integration Transmission Service and Complementary Services. FERC Electric Tariff Fourth Revised Volume No. 5, the Southern Company electric operating companies (Alabama Power Company, Georgia Power Company, and Mississippi Power Company) Open Access Transmission tariff (the "Tariff"). The Southern Company electric operating companies collectively are the Transmission Provider under the Tariff and operate their transmission facilities as a single integrated system.</span>
